<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts LAM, KLA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts LAM, KLA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded its near-term rating on semiconductor equipment makers Lam Research Corp and KLA-Tencor Corp to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- kept long-term buy ratings on the stocks.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
